      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Casting Lightning Axe during combat on small creatures (Goldhound 1/1 or Savannah Lions 2/1) is a significant resource waste. Lightning Axe deals 5 damage and requires discarding a card from a hand full of powerful spells (Balan, Danitha, Syr Alin, The Circle of Loyalty, Chains of Custody). Using it on a 1/1 or 2/1 when Chains of Custody in hand can exile a creature without card disadvantage is a poor trade.",
